                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "27f80201-0832-3660-94d8-0bc1dc6895af",
                        "entry_id": "fa1e0302-c5a8-3fef-9ace-3b66629aa15d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "false speculations, gossips"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "plural-only"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d7ed98c1-6b16-417e-8966-d70a3c52c165",
                                "sense_id": "27f80201-0832-3660-94d8-0bc1dc6895af",
                                "text": "Яви́вшись на слу́жбу с кру́пным опозда́нием, хи́трый Коротко́в, что́бы не возбужда́ть кривото́лков среди́ ни́зших слу́жащих, пря́мо прошёл к себе́ в ко́мнату и на столе́ нашёл бума́гу, в ко́ей заве́дующий подотде́лом укомплектова́ния запра́шивал заве́дующего ба́зой, — бу́дет ли вы́дано машини́сткам обмундирова́ние.",
                                "translation": "Arriving at work extremely late, a crafty Korotkov went straight to his office, so as not to give rise to any false speculation among the lower ranks, and found on his desk a memo from the head of the Supplies Sub-Section to the head of the Base asking whether the typists were to receive any special clothing.",
                                "english": "Arriving at work extremely late, a crafty Korotkov went straight to his office, so as not to give rise to any false speculation among the lower ranks, and found on his desk a memo from the head of the Supplies Sub-Section to the head of the Base asking whether the typists were to receive any special clothing."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
